  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LCS ProMotion International aim to improve traditional latrines in    rural areas of Mozambique to become safer, more hygienic and more     attractive by commercialising their affordable plastic sanplat        (sanitation platform).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LCS ProMotion International str&#xe4;var efter att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra de            traditionella latriner p&#xe5; landsbygden i Mo&#xe7;ambique f&#xf6;r att bli        s&#xe4;krare, mer hygieniskt och mer attraktivt genom att kommersialisera  sin prisv&#xe4;rda plast sanplat (sanitet plattform).</narrative>
